2026-10-14T00:20:32.8339978Z               "message": "Testes unitários, de camada web e de integração\n\n- Services com Mockito\n- Controllers com MockMvc + regras reais do SecurityConfig (401/403/400/404)\n- EcotrackApiIT: Oracle Free real via Testcontainers, Flyway e API via HTTP\n- JaCoCo com cobertura mínima de 80% das linhas",
2026-10-14T00:20:32.8340991Z               "timestamp": "2026-10-13T20:20:59-03:00",
2026-10-14T00:20:32.8341326Z               "tree_id": "67a5f5eb2c07b29553f8ad9d3a30cc81a1388c43",
